{"id":"16.09.Realoft","contentHtml":"<p>This is my first indie studio, which I <strong>founded at 18</strong> to go the full path from idea to publishing my own F2P games on Google Play. Realoft became my \"proving ground\" where I first took 100% responsibility not only for the code but also for the product, brand, and marketing.</p>\n<hr>\n<h2>Key Responsibilities and Achievements</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Founded and Developed the Brand:</strong> Came up with the name, created the logo, <mark>wrote two websites (HTML, CSS, JS)</mark>, and managed social networks to promote the studio.</li>\n<li><strong>Completed Full Publishing Cycle:</strong> Independently developed and <strong>successfully published on Google Play</strong> the studio's first game — <code>Tunnel Wave</code>.</li>\n<li><strong>Developed Several Prototypes:</strong> Under the aegis of Realoft, prototypes <code>Flying Orbit</code>, <code>Tap Circle.air</code>, and <code>Tap Block.air</code> were created, on which I honed my skills and tested new mechanics.</li>\n<li><strong>Acted as a \"One-Man Band\":</strong> Independently covered all roles — from game designer and programmer to 3D modeler, UI/UX designer, and marketer.</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h2>Key Challenge</h2>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>The main challenge</strong> was not just to make a game, but to <strong>build a full-fledged brand around it from scratch</strong>, having neither budget nor team. <strong>I independently</strong> created the identity, wrote several versions of the website, and engaged in promotion on social networks. The culmination was the <strong>successful release of <code>Tunnel Wave</code> on Google Play</strong>, which proved that I can not only develop but also independently bring products to market.</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2>Legacy and Growth</h2>\n<p>The experience with Realoft became the <strong>foundation of my entrepreneurial and product thinking</strong>. I realized in practice that creating a game is only 50% of success, and the other 50% is branding, marketing, and the ability to see things through to the end. I still apply these lessons today, now within my new studio <code>Grindset Studio</code>.</p>\n","published":true,"title":"Realoft","date":"2016-09 - 2019-01","type":"experience","tagsArray":["Mobile"],"heroVideo":null,"shortDescription":"<p>My first indie studio, <strong>founded at 18</strong>. Here I took on <mark>100% responsibility</mark> for the product, brand, and marketing for the first time.</p>\n","storeLinks":["16.09.Realoft","https://apkpure.com/developer/Realoft","https://x.com/realoftru"],"role":"founder","projectIcon":"/images/projects/16.09.Realoft/icon.webp","cardBackground":"/images/projects/16.09.Realoft/card.webp","screenshots":[{"src":"/images/projects/16.09.Realoft/screenshots/1.webp","width":1920,"height":1080},{"src":"/images/projects/16.09.Realoft/screenshots/2.webp","width":1920,"height":1080},{"src":"/images/projects/16.09.Realoft/screenshots/3.webp","width":733,"height":410},{"src":"/images/projects/16.09.Realoft/screenshots/4.webp","width":1245,"height":862},{"src":"/images/projects/16.09.Realoft/screenshots/5.webp","width":1028,"height":964}]}